{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","title":"Agentic Narcissism (Agentic Extraversion)","description":"Dimensi narsistik yang berorientasi pada aksi, prestasi, dan dominasi sosial positif.","tags":["psychology","npd","agentic"],"custom":{"description":"Dimensi narsistik yang berorientasi pada aksi, prestasi, dan dominasi sosial positif."},"fname":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"12a3d59920a95e3c185dfb794bbca0a5","updated":1782198659005,"created":1782198659005,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.npd","alias":"npd","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.npd"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agentic","alias":"agentic","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agentic"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":942},"end":{"line":17,"column":60,"offset":991},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":48,"offset":1838},"end":{"line":27,"column":87,"offset":1877},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.agentic-narcissism"}],"anchors":{"agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion":{"type":"header","text":"Agentic Narcissism (Agentic Extraversion)","value":"agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"spectrum-of-expression":{"type":"header","text":"Spectrum of Expression","value":"spectrum-of-expression","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"risk--mitigation":{"type":"header","text":"Risk & Mitigation","value":"risk--mitigation","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion\">Agentic Narcissism (Agentic Extraversion)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion-1\">Agentic Narcissism (Agentic Extraversion)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#agentic-narcissism-agentic-extraversion-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>Agentik adalah sisi narsistik yang berorientasi pada <strong>aksi, prestasi, dominasi sosial positif, kepemimpinan, dan self-promotion</strong>. Ini adalah energi ekspansi diri.</p>\n<h2 id=\"spectrum-of-expression\">Spectrum of Expression<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#spectrum-of-expression\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Wajah Sehat</strong>: Percaya diri, ambisius, berani mengambil risiko, dan memiliki leadership yang kuat. Masih fleksibel terhadap kritik, data, dan feedback.</li>\n<li><strong>Wajah Rusak</strong>: Berubah menjadi <em>grandiosity</em>. Merasa semua orang harus mengikuti ritmenya, menganggap kritik sebagai penghambat, dan mengaitkan semua keberhasilan hanya pada dirinya sendiri.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"risk--mitigation\">Risk &#x26; Mitigation<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#risk--mitigation\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Risiko</strong>: Fantasi superioritas yang terlalu besar dibanding kapasitas nyata.</li>\n<li><strong>Obat Sosial</strong>: Membutuhkan <em>reality check</em>, akuntabilitas, data, dan feedback yang jujur.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Agentik = energi ekspansi diri. Sehat kalau dikawal realitas; rusak kalau berubah jadi fantasi superioritas.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{